    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-xuebaochai",
      "accountName": "薛宝钗",
      "timestamp": 1770003405,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "许你恼。只是别把我说不知道，也算成存心笑你。",
